# WHAT THIS IMAGE DEPENDS ON. The image installs requirements.txt, the lock
# made from this file (every package pinned, with hashes):
#     python3 scripts/image_locks.py lock facebook_groups
# Edit here, then re-lock; never edit requirements.txt by hand.
#
# facebook_groups' OWN dependencies, installed only into this Actor's image.
#
# ONE scraping package, and NO session or browser dependency at all: this Actor
# reads public group pages over plain HTTP and holds no credentials, so there is
# nothing here for authentication, cookie storage or a browser.
#
# h2 comes with the [http2] extra, which the replay engine prefers.
httpx[http2]==0.28.1

