#   anthropic        ai/claude.py and ai/segmentation.py
#   reportlab        reports/facebook_groups_report.py (the PDF)
#   python-dotenv    config.py, which ai/claude.py imports for the API key
#   arabic-reshaper  \ the PDF renderer shapes Arabic text, and real groups
#   python-bidi      / post in Arabic (both measured test groups do)
#
# reports/dashboard.py writes HTML with the standard library only.
